-- cpl_memory rows for the Rule 9 checkpoint of the plain session with Sam of 2026-11-20 (the Commons order mock and
-- the outline fixes). DRAFTED by the checkpoint-docs worker, NOT applied and NOT pointed at by kb/migrations/.apply: the
-- session applies it with one execute_sql call. INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING. Two rows are Sam's rulings in
-- his words (verified; sources docs/reference/sam_rulings.md and the two vault braindumps of the day); the rest are the
-- session's facts, pitfalls, question and decision (proposed). No person's contact detail in any row.
-- Every summary is at most 400 characters (cpl_memory_summary_check), asserted by the script that wrote this file.
-- The credit recommendations joining the curation order are already r-curation-order-adds-crs-sam-2026-11-20 (S689).
-- ROLLBACK: kb/migrations/2026-11-20_plain_session_checkpoint_memory_rows_rollback.sql
insert into public.cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,status,source,verified_by,verified_at,author,event_date) values
('r-no-longer-offered-sam-2026-11-20','decision','No longer offered: a set-aside for courses a college stopped offering, strict at first','Sam, 2026-11-20: "inactive is the wrong term...maybe no longer offered..." and "we''d need to start with yes to everything... spring 26 working backwards to fall 24 is right." A set-aside for courses and programs the state lists and a college stopped offering; every factor must agree. Nothing is set aside until the added term reports and the catalog check exist.',array['commons','m-id','no-longer-offered','sam-ruling'],'verified','Sam, in session 2026-11-20 (the plain session); docs/reference/sam_rulings.md; CPLBrain braindump-2026-11-20-1300-no-longer-offered-set-aside','Sam (in session)',now(),'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('r-hand-over-in-place-sam-2026-11-20','decision','Hand it over in place: a side panel with a drop box, Try the link, paste and an API box','Sam, 2026-11-20: "item or link and a try the link button" and "need to be able to do this for all our commons datasets". A course or a college opens in a side panel on the same page (the Courses card; College Data Collection''s panel) with a drop box, Try the link (a link that reads is saved as the source and re-read), paste and an API procedure box.',array['commons','college-data-collection','side-panel','sam-ruling'],'verified','Sam, in session 2026-11-20 (the plain session); docs/reference/sam_rulings.md; CPLBrain braindump-2026-11-20-1546-hand-over-in-place-drop-box-try-the-link','Sam (in session)',now(),'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('f-mid-census-first-pass-2026-11-20','fact','M-ID census, first pass: 10,412 of 15,720 counted cards have no outcomes','Plain session, 2026-11-20, rough: of 15,720 counted M-ID cards (the Commons counts 15,911; one definition owed), 10,412 have no SLO or objective text from any local course, 635 no description (455 noncredit), 154 no published local courses, 3,440 one college; 5,305 have both. Scripts: CPLBrain commons-order-mock/. An earlier 5,750 read one field and counted flagged cards.',array['commons','m-id','census','course-outlines'],'proposed','CPLBrain/04-projects/cpl-initiative/commons-order-mock/ (mid_census_one_base.py, README)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('f-credit-first-ranking-2026-11-20','fact','893 counted M-ID cards carry credit; rank collection by them','Plain session, 2026-11-20: 893 of 15,720 counted cards have an exhibit or credit recommendation pointing to them (kb/coci_articulations.json, read raw); 407 have no outcomes. Six of the eight most-linked have no published list of local courses (COMM M1037 Group Communication, 67 links), so that code fix comes before any collection for them.',array['commons','m-id','cpl','collection-ranking'],'proposed','CPLBrain/04-projects/cpl-initiative/commons-order-mock/README.md (version 11)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('f-outline-access-by-college-2026-11-20','fact','Course outline access by college, 2026-11-20','program_source_registry, live read 2026-11-20: 18 colleges public and printing SLOs, 17 public unchecked, 14 public with no SLOs, 59 with no public site found, 6 behind a sign-in, 3 refuse our reader, 1 not reached. Outcomes are on file for 29 colleges; 3 of the 69 out of reach already have them (Coastline, Golden West, Orange Coast), so the registry is stale there.',array['commons','course-outlines','college-data-collection'],'proposed','program_source_registry live read; CPLBrain commons-order-mock/README.md (versions 4, 12)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('p-check-saved-reads-before-blocked-2026-11-20','pitfall','Check the reader''s saved reads before advising that a source is blocked','Plain session, 2026-11-20: the session advised holding bot-checked catalog sites on a test from its own cloud address. The committed captures showed our named reader reads North Orange and Southwestern with no challenge (runs 43342034608, 44529722751) and stops at one (#3536). Read the captures and the registry first; probe only from the runner.',array['collection','college-reads','pitfall'],'proposed','docs/kb-notes/methodology-check-the-saved-reads-before-calling-a-source-blocked.md',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('p-memory-summary-400-chars-2026-11-20','pitfall','A cpl_memory summary over 400 characters refuses the whole insert','Plain session, 2026-11-20: cpl_memory_summary_check caps a summary at 400 characters, and one longer row in a multi-row insert refuses every row, so nothing lands. Assert every summary''s length with a script before applying a memory receipt.',array['cpl-memory','receipts','pitfall'],'proposed','kb/migrations/2026-11-20_commons_outline_fixes_memory_rows.sql (its header)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('q-term-report-sources-2026-11-20','question','Where do the Spring 2026, Spring 2025 and Fall 2024 term reports come from?','Plain session, 2026-11-20: no-longer-offered needs term course files for Spring 2026 back to Fall 2024 beside kb/reference/cb_course_basic_fall2025.csv. The Data Mart did not open from the session (certificate error, then 503) and kb/_fetch_program_course_files.py has never succeeded, so whether it holds past terms is unverified. Sam may drop them by hand; a runner fetch is untried.',array['commons','no-longer-offered','data-sources','question'],'proposed','CPLBrain commons-order-mock/README.md (version 11)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20'),
('d-college-opens-cdc-panel-2026-11-20','decision','A college named on a Commons page opens College Data Collection''s own panel','Plain session, 2026-11-20, left to the session by Sam ("disregard my advise on cdc unless you want to allow the same type of drag and drop there too"): a college opens College Data Collection''s own panel for it, at course outlines, with the drop box, Try the link and the API boxes in it. One panel, no duplicate. His to revise.',array['commons','college-data-collection','side-panel'],'proposed','CPLBrain commons-order-mock/README.md (version 14)',null,null,'Sky (plain session, 2026-11-20)',date '2026-11-20')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

